--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Bundled material (vendored byte-for-byte; sha256-pinned in _vendor/SHA256SUMS)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- src/context_compliance_optimizer/_vendor/pyrit/datasets/executors/red_teaming/
      context_compliance/context_compliance.yaml
    Adversarial-persona system prompt that turns the objective into the
    benign opening user question.
- src/context_compliance_optimizer/_vendor/pyrit/datasets/executors/
      simulated_target/context_compliance_target.yaml
    Simulated-target system prompt that fabricates the affirmative assistant
    answer (a benign answer plus an offer to carry out the objective).

The CCA control flow (rendering the two vendored templates, routing both
adversarial generations through the constrained LLM client, and assembling the
fabricated conversation history) is reimplemented from scratch in
src/context_compliance_optimizer/ (original to this module, MIT). No prompt or
template body is reproduced in authored code.

